description: Broadcast security - encryption, idempotency, webhooks
globs: "{app/api,publishers,lib,workers}/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: true
---

# Security

- Encrypt OAuth tokens at rest (AES-256-GCM, random IV per write)
- Never log plaintext tokens
- Idempotency keys on every publish
- Honor 429 Retry-After
- Delivery webhooks must verify HMAC; forgeries return 400
- No real social credentials in the repo
